{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-01", "text": "快递放前台了，记得拿", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-02", "text": "会议挪到周三上午十点", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-03", "text": "验证码 6248，五分钟内有效", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-04", "text": "门禁卡在抽屉第二层", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-05", "text": "报表已上传共享盘", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-06", "text": "明天下雨，出门带伞", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-07", "text": "群里通知周五停水检修", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-08", "text": "高铁 G102，检票口 A12", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-09", "text": "合同第三页错字改好了", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-10", "text": "午饭十二点，食堂二楼", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-11", "text": "体检预约单发你邮箱了", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-12", "text": "文件名别改，直接回传", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-13", "text": "打印机会后空着，随便用", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-14", "text": "签到表放门口桌上", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-15", "text": "发票抬头写公司全称", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-16", "text": "班车提前十分钟发车", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-17", "text": "备用钥匙在前台第二个抽屉", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-18", "text": "茶水间的杯子补了新的一批", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-19", "text": "门禁刷卡记录导出到共享盘", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-20", "text": "周五的例会纪要已发出", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-21", "text": "货架标签统一换成蓝色", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-22", "text": "包裹编号 7712，凭号取", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-23", "text": "电梯年检贴在轿厢右侧", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-24", "text": "值班表按工号顺序排", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-25", "text": "二楼打印机换了新硒鼓", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-26", "text": "签收单拍照传群里即可", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-27", "text": "会议室门牌改成 B 区", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-28", "text": "季度表格模板已更新", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-29", "text": "前台备了临时访客证", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-30", "text": "快递统一放在侧门架", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-31", "text": "周四下午网络例行维护", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-insufficient-32", "text": "座位按报名序号排列", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "validation-ei-insufficient-33", "text": "门禁密码改成 4412 了", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-ei-insufficient-34", "text": "快递柜密码 8807，今天取", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-ei-insufficient-35", "text": "会议室改到 B305", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-ei-insufficient-36", "text": "周报模板换 v3 了", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "test-ei-insufficient-37", "text": "投影遥控器在抽屉左格", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-ei-insufficient-38", "text": "空调滤网周五统一更换", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-ei-insufficient-39", "text": "回执截止到周五中午", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-ei-insufficient-40", "text": "资料包在共享盘第二层", "axis": "EI", "label": "insufficient", "split": "test"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-01", "text": "周末约了三拨人，一个人待着反而没劲", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-02", "text": "聊完一整晚，我整个人都充电了", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-03", "text": "人多的时候我话就特别多", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-04", "text": "开会讨论比自己闷头想更带劲", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-05", "text": "一有空就想找人唠两句", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-06", "text": "冷清两天我就想约饭了", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-07", "text": "跟朋友挤一块儿才觉得放松", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-08", "text": "新同事来了我第一个去搭话", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-09", "text": "越聊越有精神，停不下来", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-10", "text": "出门转一圈回来，心情立马好了", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-11", "text": "我就喜欢热闹，安静久了发慌", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-12", "text": "想到能当面聊，比发消息痛快", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-13", "text": "聚完餐我还舍不得散场", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-14", "text": "一个人吃饭没意思，总想拉个人", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-15", "text": "被点名发言我反而来劲", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-16", "text": "这周排了四场局，刚好", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-17", "text": "约上人聊一整下午才叫过瘾", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-18", "text": "家里太静，我总想拉人来坐坐", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-19", "text": "一进人群我就有话说", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-20", "text": "讨论越热烈我越不想走", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-21", "text": "空一天没人说话就发闷", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-22", "text": "我偏爱那种一桌人的饭", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-23", "text": "有人搭话，思路一下就活了", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-24", "text": "隔三差五得聚一次才舒坦", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-25", "text": "有人一起吃饭，胃口都好些", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-26", "text": "我最怕一整天不开口", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-27", "text": "现场七嘴八舌反倒有意思", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-28", "text": "约人比自己待着提神", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-29", "text": "一有局我就想去", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-30", "text": "聊到半夜也不觉得累", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-31", "text": "人多时我反而更放得开", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-e-32", "text": "三天没聚会就有点闷", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "train"}
{"id": "validation-ei-e-33", "text": "跟人聊完我就不困了", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-ei-e-34", "text": "办公室有人说话我效率更高", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-ei-e-35", "text": "一整天没见人，憋得慌", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-ei-e-36", "text": "还是当面聊最过瘾", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "test-ei-e-37", "text": "群里一有人接话我就精神了", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-ei-e-38", "text": "约的人越多我越开心", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-ei-e-39", "text": "独处半天就想找人说话", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-ei-e-40", "text": "现场人多，我状态最好", "axis": "EI", "label": "E", "split": "test"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-01", "text": "这两天不想见人，想自己待着", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-02", "text": "聊久了得缓一缓，安静会儿才回血", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-03", "text": "一个人看书比聚会舒服多了", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-04", "text": "人多的时候我总想早点撤", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-05", "text": "周末不排安排，在家就挺好", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-06", "text": "说话太多会累，独处才充电", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-07", "text": "我更愿意先自己想明白再开口", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-08", "text": "饭局结束我反而松了口气", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-09", "text": "电话能免就免，文字慢慢回", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-10", "text": "安静一下午，脑子才清楚", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-11", "text": "人一多我就懒得接话", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-12", "text": "今天谁也不约，留给自己", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-13", "text": "想事情的时候别打扰我", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-14", "text": "比起出门，我更想窝着", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-15", "text": "连续社交两天，得歇一天", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-16", "text": "我习惯先把话在心里过一遍", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-17", "text": "应酬一多我就想躲回房间", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-18", "text": "安静待着才是我补电的方式", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-19", "text": "别连着约我，中间留一天", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-20", "text": "人多时我更愿意听着", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-21", "text": "周末关掉消息，谁也不找", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-22", "text": "想明白之前不爱开口", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-23", "text": "回家把门一关，整个人才松", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-24", "text": "比起热闹，我更挑清净", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-25", "text": "安静房间比热闹场面更适合我", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-26", "text": "连着两天应酬，得缓过来", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-27", "text": "我习惯把话留到想清楚", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-28", "text": "别拉我进大群聊", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-29", "text": "一个人走走就够回血了", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-30", "text": "会议一散我就想清静", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-31", "text": "我不太爱被临时叫出门", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-ei-i-32", "text": "电话响了我常先不接", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "train"}
{"id": "validation-ei-i-33", "text": "独处一会儿，情绪就回来了", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-ei-i-34", "text": "应酬完最想一个人走走", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-ei-i-35", "text": "我话少，但想得不少", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-ei-i-36", "text": "别安排太满，留点空白", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "test-ei-i-37", "text": "人多一整天，回家只想安静", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-ei-i-38", "text": "我靠自己待着恢复状态", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-ei-i-39", "text": "能不视频就不视频吧", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-ei-i-40", "text": "想清楚了再说，别催我", "axis": "EI", "label": "I", "split": "test"}
