{"id": "train-sn-s-01", "text": "先把数据拉出来再看，别猜", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-02", "text": "上次这么办成了，这次照着来", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-03", "text": "你说的方法我试过，确实管用", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-04", "text": "给我具体步骤，别讲大道理", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-05", "text": "现场看过才敢下结论", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-06", "text": "按去年的表填，错不了", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-07", "text": "我更信自己经手过的例子", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-08", "text": "先核对原始记录再说", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-09", "text": "讲讲实际怎么操作的", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-10", "text": "数字对不上，别的先别谈", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-11", "text": "有样例吗，看一眼就明白", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-12", "text": "我按说明书一步步来", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-13", "text": "这结论得有实测撑着", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-14", "text": "别急着推演，先看这三类记录", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-15", "text": "经验告诉我这样最稳", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-16", "text": "把流程写细点，我照着做", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-17", "text": "拿实物比一比最省事", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-18", "text": "我照着上次的参数调", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-19", "text": "先把清单核完再动", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-20", "text": "听描述不如看一眼记录", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-21", "text": "这法子我实操过三回", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-22", "text": "有原始凭证才踏实", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-23", "text": "别推测，量出来是多少就多少", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-24", "text": "按既有流程走不会出岔", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-25", "text": "先把旧记录翻出来对", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-26", "text": "我信量出来的结果", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-27", "text": "步骤写清楚我才动手", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-28", "text": "试过一遍比想十遍强", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-29", "text": "按样板做最不容易错", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-30", "text": "先看实际样品再谈", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-31", "text": "数据没齐先别下判断", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-s-32", "text": "我照着清单逐项核", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "train"}
{"id": "validation-sn-s-33", "text": "先量一下尺寸再下单", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-sn-s-34", "text": "我照着旧单子重做了一遍", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-sn-s-35", "text": "手感不对，得亲手试", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-sn-s-36", "text": "有凭有据我才点头", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "test-sn-s-37", "text": "把上回的照片翻出来比对", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-sn-s-38", "text": "别谈概念，说个数", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-sn-s-39", "text": "我按实际耗时排的", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-sn-s-40", "text": "拆开看过，里面就这样", "axis": "SN", "label": "S", "split": "test"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-01", "text": "这两件事看着像同一个规律", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-02", "text": "我在想往后还能怎么变", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-03", "text": "换个角度，说不定整条路都通了", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-04", "text": "先别管细节，整体趋势更值得看", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-05", "text": "有没有一种更巧的做法", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-06", "text": "这背后应该还有层意思", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-07", "text": "我总忍不住想几种可能", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-08", "text": "把点连起来看，就清楚了", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-09", "text": "说不定下次会完全不一样", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-10", "text": "我更在意它指向哪儿", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-11", "text": "先画个大框架，细节后面补", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-12", "text": "这模式我在别处也见过", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-13", "text": "要是条件变了会怎样", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-14", "text": "别被眼前的例子框住", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-15", "text": "我有个还没验证的猜想", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-16", "text": "抽象一层看，其实很简单", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-17", "text": "我总在琢磨还能往哪延展", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-18", "text": "把几件小事放一起看就有轮廓了", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-19", "text": "换个假设，整盘都活了", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-20", "text": "我更想抓那个共性", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-21", "text": "先设想几种走向再挑", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-22", "text": "表面不同，骨架其实一样", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-23", "text": "顺着趋势往后推两步", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-24", "text": "有没有更省一层的解释", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-25", "text": "我在找这几件事的共同点", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-26", "text": "说不定换个框架就顺了", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-27", "text": "先想大方向，细节后补", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-28", "text": "这条线索能延到别处", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-29", "text": "我习惯先问还有没有别的解释", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-30", "text": "把零散现象串成一条线", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-31", "text": "往后两年大概会变样", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-sn-n-32", "text": "我更爱琢磨没写出来的那层", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "train"}
{"id": "validation-sn-n-33", "text": "顺着这条线想下去挺有意思", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-sn-n-34", "text": "好像能推导出另一套做法", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-sn-n-35", "text": "我先看它属于哪一类", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-sn-n-36", "text": "表面是巧了，底下有原因", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "test-sn-n-37", "text": "想象一下三年后的样子", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-sn-n-38", "text": "换个前提，结论就翻了", "axis": "SN", "label": "N", "split": "test"}
