{"id": "train-tf-t-01", "text": "按规则来，对谁都一样", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-02", "text": "先把成本算清楚再定", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-03", "text": "这个方案漏洞在第三步", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-04", "text": "结论得站得住逻辑", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-05", "text": "我按标准评，不看关系", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
