{"id": "train-tf-t-22", "text": "我按代价排序做选择", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-23", "text": "有反例就得改结论", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-24", "text": "先把对错分清，再谈别的", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-25", "text": "先把规则摆平再谈例外", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-26", "text": "我用同一把尺子量", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-27", "text": "成本收益算完就好定", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-28", "text": "这步推不出那个结论", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-29", "text": "事实先于感受摆着", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-30", "text": "口径不一致没法比", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-31", "text": "碰上反例，整套推演要重来", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-t-32", "text": "我只认能复核的依据", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "train"}
{"id": "validation-tf-t-33", "text": "先把前提摆齐", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-tf-t-34", "text": "这样算下来不划算", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-tf-t-35", "text": "证据不够，先别下结论", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-tf-t-36", "text": "口径统一才好比较", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "test-tf-t-37", "text": "我按条款一条条对", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-tf-t-38", "text": "情绪归情绪，账归账", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-tf-t-39", "text": "反例一出现就得推翻", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-tf-t-40", "text": "谁说的不要紧，看依据", "axis": "TF", "label": "T", "split": "test"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-01", "text": "这么做他会不会难受", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-02", "text": "我更在意大家能不能接受", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-03", "text": "规则之外总得留点人情", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-04", "text": "先问问当事人怎么想", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-05", "text": "别为了省事让人难堪", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-06", "text": "这个决定会伤到谁", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-07", "text": "我宁愿慢一点，也别寒了心", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-08", "text": "合不合得来比划算更要紧", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-09", "text": "他最近不容易，多担待些", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-10", "text": "我按心里那杆秤来", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-11", "text": "面子得给，话别说死", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-12", "text": "团队气氛比指标更怕坏", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-13", "text": "换成是我，也希望被体谅", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-14", "text": "别把人当成数字", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-15", "text": "有人不自在，我就想改", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-16", "text": "这事我做着不踏实", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-17", "text": "先想想这话落到谁身上", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-18", "text": "别让老实人吃亏", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-19", "text": "我更怕气氛僵掉", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-20", "text": "换个位置，我也希望被让一步", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-21", "text": "规矩硬，话可以软", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-22", "text": "有人为难我就想缓一缓", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-23", "text": "心里过不去的就不做", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-24", "text": "比起赢，我更想大家都好受", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-25", "text": "别让谁被晾在一边", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-26", "text": "我先看大家舒不舒服", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-27", "text": "话说软一点不亏", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-28", "text": "他难处我得先顾", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-29", "text": "硬规矩也要留台阶", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-30", "text": "伤和气的事我不做", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-31", "text": "换我也会盼着被体谅", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-tf-f-32", "text": "心里别扭比账面更要紧", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "train"}
{"id": "validation-tf-f-33", "text": "先照顾一下他的处境", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-tf-f-34", "text": "说得过去，但心里过不去", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-tf-f-35", "text": "宁可自己多担点", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-tf-f-36", "text": "别让谁下不来台", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "test-tf-f-37", "text": "关系比这一次的输赢要紧", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-tf-f-38", "text": "我怕话说重了", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-tf-f-39", "text": "大家舒服比快更值", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-tf-f-40", "text": "体谅一下，不差这点", "axis": "TF", "label": "F", "split": "test"}
{"id": "train-jp-insufficient-01", "text": "快递放前台了，记得拿", "axis": "JP", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
