{"id": "train-jp-insufficient-15", "text": "发票抬头写公司全称", "axis": "JP", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-insufficient-16", "text": "班车提前十分钟发车", "axis": "JP", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-insufficient-17", "text": "备用钥匙在前台第二个抽屉", "axis": "JP", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-insufficient-18", "text": "茶水间的杯子补了新的一批", "axis": "JP", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-insufficient-19", "text": "门禁刷卡记录导出到共享盘", "axis": "JP", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-insufficient-20", "text": "周五的例会纪要已发出", "axis": "JP", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
