{"id": "train-jp-insufficient-22", "text": "包裹编号 7712，凭号取", "axis": "JP", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-insufficient-23", "text": "电梯年检贴在轿厢右侧", "axis": "JP", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-insufficient-24", "text": "值班表按工号顺序排", "axis": "JP", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-insufficient-25", "text": "二楼打印机换了新硒鼓", "axis": "JP", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-insufficient-26", "text": "签收单拍照传群里即可", "axis": "JP", "label": "insufficient", "split": "train"}
