{"id": "train-jp-j-01", "text": "行程提前排好我才安心", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-02", "text": "定下来就别再改了", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-03", "text": "我把清单逐项划掉了", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-04", "text": "先定截止日，再谈别的", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-05", "text": "事情悬着我不舒服", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-06", "text": "按表走，今天该到第三步", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-07", "text": "结论先落纸，别拖着", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-08", "text": "计划做细，执行才稳", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-09", "text": "我习惯提前一天备齐", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-10", "text": "收个尾吧，别留半截", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-11", "text": "每项都要有明确归属", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-12", "text": "时间表我发群里了", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-13", "text": "越早敲定越省事", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-14", "text": "我不喜欢临时变卦", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-15", "text": "归档完才算做完", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-16", "text": "先把范围框死", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-17", "text": "出门前列好单子才踏实", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-18", "text": "定了版本就别再翻", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-19", "text": "每件事都要有个收口", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-20", "text": "提前把材料备齐", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-21", "text": "拖着没结的事我记着", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-22", "text": "按日程走完一项划一项", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-23", "text": "先写清楚谁负责哪块", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-24", "text": "早早定下来，后面才不乱", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-25", "text": "提前把表排完才放心", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-26", "text": "每步定死，别临时改", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-27", "text": "没收尾我睡不着", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-28", "text": "清单划完才叫完成", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-29", "text": "交付节点先写进日程", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-30", "text": "材料我头天晚上就装好", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-31", "text": "范围先框住再开工", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-j-32", "text": "悬而未决最耗神", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "train"}
{"id": "validation-jp-j-33", "text": "周一的料周日就备好", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-jp-j-34", "text": "按节点验收，不拖", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-jp-j-35", "text": "定了就照着执行", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "validation-jp-j-36", "text": "空着一项我都惦记", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "validation"}
{"id": "test-jp-j-37", "text": "先把待办清空", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-jp-j-38", "text": "日程写死我才踏实", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-jp-j-39", "text": "一步一确认，别跳", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "test"}
{"id": "test-jp-j-40", "text": "交了才算结案", "axis": "JP", "label": "J", "split": "test"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-01", "text": "先别定死，到了再说", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-02", "text": "多留几个选项，回头挑", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-03", "text": "计划赶不上变化，随性点", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-04", "text": "我想先逛逛看有什么", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-05", "text": "截止前再定也来得及", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-06", "text": "别急着收，说不定有更好的", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-07", "text": "我更爱边走边调整", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-08", "text": "空着一段才有趣", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-09", "text": "方案留个口子，方便改", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-10", "text": "临时起意往往最尽兴", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-11", "text": "不用排满，看心情", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-12", "text": "先试试水，不合适再换", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-13", "text": "我讨厌被日程绑住", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-14", "text": "多比较几家再决定", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-15", "text": "留白比排满舒服", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-16", "text": "想到什么再加，不急", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-17", "text": "留点余地，别一次排满", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-18", "text": "到时候看情况再挑", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-19", "text": "我更喜欢边做边改", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-20", "text": "多备两案，随时换", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
{"id": "train-jp-p-21", "text": "别急着关门，再看看", "axis": "JP", "label": "P", "split": "train"}
